<section id="how-it-works" class="section reveal">
	<h2>How Eastern Manufacturing Actually Works</h2>
	<ul class="work-list">
		<li>
			Orders come in via WhatsApp, Line, WeChat, email PDFs, government tender portals, and
			in-person calls
		</li>
		<li>Production is tracked on whiteboards, paper travellers, shared Excel</li>
		<li>Finance reconciles by re-typing numbers into a separate package</li>
	</ul>
	<p class="framing">Any ERP that forces you to stop using these channels is dead on arrival.</p>
</section>
